ayer Friendly: Zen &amp; Packs</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zen Mode:</strong> Built-in &quot;Cyber Wooden Fish&quot; mechanic acts as a safety net, helping you accumulate Merit<strong>(Karma)</strong> and stage a comeback when resources run out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various Packs:</strong> Starter Packs, Daily Packs, and Online Coin Packs are all free to claim, ensuring a smooth gaming experience!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Multiple Control Modes:</strong> The game defaults to keyboard controls that recreate the arcade experience, but also supports Controllers. You can also select &quot;Mouse Only Mode&quot; in the settings to play the entire game with just one hand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Multi-Language Support: The game currently supports 9 languages. If your language is not included, please contact me, and I will add it for you！</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114590/extras/d49cb3e343353880c7b2c66731c84758.poster.avif?t=1782286917\" width=1148 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114590/extras/d49cb3e343353880c7b2c66731c84758.webm?t=1782286917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114590/extras/d49cb3e343353880c7b2c66731c84758.mp4?t=1782286917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💎 <strong>Game Promise</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Worry-free Experience:</strong> One-time purchase, complete experience. No in-app purchases, no microtransactions or gacha. All wealth is seized by your skill and strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>💌 A Word from the Solo Developer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello! I made this game because real-life coin pushers just weren't satisfying enough. &quot;Knock on Fate&quot; has evolved thanks to player feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am committed to serving my players. If you have suggestions or encounter issues, I am always listening. Thank you for supporting indie games!</p>", "short_description": "Challenge the physics of Fate in this immersive Coin Pusher RPG! Topple towering &quot;Coin Pagodas&quot; and trigger the massive &quot;Dragon Trial&quot; Jackpot. Collect over 100 historical artifacts, Appraise them for permanent buffs, and define your own playstyle. No microtransactions—just pure physics strategy!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114590/c1e834a25b56afa071199da07ad3e7f8ec91ed85/header.jpg?t=1782286917", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114590/a6561771dd552441961bfd8891100ff379bf8a7f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782286917", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114590/a6561771dd552441961bfd8891100ff379bf8a7f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782286917", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-7700K / AMD Ryzen 5 2600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1070 8GB / AMD Radeon 